  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "Enhance your pricing strategy with the Product Pricing Module is conditional pricing capabilities. This feature allows you to set specific rules to increase or decrease prices based on predefined conditions. Whether offering discounts during sales periods or adjusting prices according to market trends, the flexibility provided by conditional pricing ensures that your pricing strategy is always aligned with your business goals.": "Verbeter uw prijsstrategie met de Product Pricing Module en voorwaardelijke prijsmogelijkheden. ",
